  "description": "Production-ready runtime implementations for HoneyDrunk.OS Grid. Provides GridContext, NodeContext, OperationContext implementations, transport binders (HTTP/messaging/jobs), context mappers, GridContextMiddleware, lifecycle orchestration, AgentsInterop, telemetry (GridActivitySource), and unified bootstrapping (AddHoneyDrunkGrid).",
