  "releaseNotes": "v0.4.0: BREAKING CHANGES - Two-phase GridContext initialization (constructor + Initialize()), AddBaggage() replaces WithBaggage() (void return, mutates in-place), BeginScope() removed, IGridContextAccessor now read-only non-nullable (reads from HttpContext.RequestServices), IGridContextFactory.CreateRoot() removed, static mapper classes (HttpContextMapper, MessagingContextMapper, JobContextMapper), registration guard prevents duplicate AddHoneyDrunkGrid() calls. See CHANGELOG.md for migration guide.",
